// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 7
window.T7_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"advanced – cast","cards":[{"w":"advanced","p":"adj.","d":"far on or ahead in development or progress; complex or high-level","c":"先進的高級的；進階的","s":"The research laboratory develops advanced technology for the national deep-space program.","t":"該研究實驗室為國家深空計畫開發先進的技術。"},{"w":"advance","p":"v.","d":"to move forward in a purposeful way; to make progress","c":"前進；推進；提升（動詞）","s":"The army continued to advance steadily toward the enemy border despite the severe blizzard.","t":"儘管遭遇嚴重的暴風雪，軍隊仍繼續朝敵國邊界穩定前進。"},{"w":"advance","p":"n.","d":"a forward movement; a development or improvement","c":"進步；發展；預付款（可數）","s":"Please book your hotel room weeks in advance to avoid paying exorbitant holiday prices.","t":"請提前數週事先預訂飯店房間，以避免支付昂貴的假日價格。"},{"w":"anxious","p":"adj.","d":"experiencing worry, unease, or nervousness; eagerly wishing","c":"焦慮不安的；渴望的；急切的","s":"Jordan was extremely anxious about his son's safety when the severe typhoon hit the coastal town.","t":"當強烈颱風襲擊沿海城鎮時，喬丹對兒子的安危感到極度焦慮不安。"},{"w":"anxiety","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of worry, nervousness, or unease about something","c":"焦慮；不安；掛念（不可數/可數）","s":"Practicing deep breathing exercises every morning can significantly reduce exam anxiety for students.","t":"每天早晨進行深呼吸練習可以顯著減輕學生的考試焦慮。"},{"w":"ash","p":"n.","d":"the powdery residue left after the burning of any substance","c":"灰燼；骨灰（常用複數 ashes）","s":"After the destructive midnight fire, there was nothing left of the wooden cabin except a pile of ash.","t":"在破壞性的午夜大火之後，木屋除了留下一堆灰燼外一無所有。"},{"w":"rise from the ashes","p":"v.phr.","d":"to be renewed or restored after being completely destroyed or ruined","c":"浴火重生；從廢墟中崛起","s":"The historic city destroyed during the great war managed to rise from the ashes within two decades.","t":"這座在世界大戰中被摧毀的歷史名城在二十年內成功從廢墟中重新崛起。"},{"w":"bang","p":"v.","d":"to strike or put down forcefully and noisily","c":"猛撞；重擊；發出砰然巨響","s":"Sue cried out loud in pain after she accidentally banged her head on the low ceiling beam.","t":"蘇在頭部意外猛撞到低矮的天花板橫樑後痛得大聲哭叫。"},{"w":"bang","p":"n.","d":"a sudden loud, sharp noise","c":"砰然巨響；猛擊（可數）","s":"As soon as the nervous runners heard the sharp bang of the starter's gun, they took off sprinting.","t":"緊張的跑者們一聽到發令槍的尖銳砰然巨響，便立即拔腿狂奔。"},{"w":"brass","p":"n.","d":"a yellow alloy of copper and zinc, often used for instruments or fittings","c":"黃銅；銅管樂器（不可數）","s":"He is an exceptionally talented trumpeter who performs regularly in the municipal brass band downtown.","t":"他是一位技藝非凡的長號手，經常在市中心的市立銅管樂團演出。"},{"w":"bury","p":"v.","d":"to put or hide underground, or to cover completely","c":"埋葬；埋藏；使沉浸","s":"To overcome his grief after the breakup, David decided to bury himself in his medical research.","t":"為了克服分手後的悲傷，大衛決定讓自己埋首沉浸於醫學研究之中。"},{"w":"capture","p":"v.","d":"to take into custody by force; to accurately depict or catch","c":"俘虜；捕獲；生動捕捉（動詞）","s":"The brave soldiers successfully captured the enemy spies before they could leak confidential defense files.","t":"英勇的士兵在敵方間諜洩露機密國防文件之前成功將其俘虜捕獲。"},{"w":"capture one's imagination","p":"v.phr.","d":"to fascinate someone or stimulate their creativity and interest","c":"引起某人的高度興趣；激發某人的想像力","s":"The author's magical fantasy novel has truly captured the imagination of young teenage readers worldwide.","t":"作者這部奇幻魔法小說確實激發了全世界年輕讀者的想像力／引起了高度興趣。"},{"w":"cast","p":"v.","d":"to throw something forcefully; to cause light or shadow to appear","c":"投擲；投射（光影）；選派角色（動詞）","s":"Paul stood quietly by the rushing river and cast his fishing line into the deep blue water.","t":"保羅靜靜站在湍急的河邊，將他的釣魚線拋投進深藍色的水中。"},{"w":"cast","p":"n.","d":"all the actors in a play or film; a rigid casing for broken bones","c":"全體演員；石膏夾板（可數）","s":"Several award-winning international superstars are included in the impressive cast of the new science fiction film.","t":"幾位備受殊榮的國際巨星皆包含在這部新科幻電影令人讚嘆的全體演員陣容中。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"chop – golfer","cards":[{"w":"chop","p":"v.","d":"to cut into pieces with repeated sharp blows of an axe or knife","c":"剁碎；砍；大幅削減（動詞）","s":"The film director decided to chop several unnecessary minutes off the final cut of the movie.","t":"電影導演決定從電影最終剪輯中剪掉削減幾分鐘不必要的畫面。"},{"w":"chop","p":"n.","d":"a thick slice of meat, especially pork or lamb, typically including a rib","c":"帶骨肉排；豬排；羊排（可數）","s":"My mother grilled four delicious lamb chops seasoned with rosemary and garlic for our family dinner.","t":"我母親烤了四塊用迷迭香和大蒜調味的美味羊排作為全家晚餐。"},{"w":"coconut","p":"n.","d":"the large, oval, brown seed of a tropical palm tree with edible white flesh and liquid","c":"椰子；椰肉（可數）","s":"Drinking refreshing and chilled coconut juice on a hot summer afternoon can make you feel instantly cooler.","t":"在炎熱的夏日午後飲用清爽冰鎮的椰子汁，可以讓你瞬間感到涼爽。"},{"w":"continent","p":"n.","d":"any of the world's main continuous expanses of land","c":"大陸；洲（可數）","s":"Asia is scientifically recognized as the largest continent in the world, closely followed by Africa.","t":"亞洲在科學上被公認為世界上面積最大的大洲／大陸，非洲緊隨其後。"},{"w":"continental","p":"adj.","d":"forming or belonging to a continent; typical of mainland Europe","c":"大陸的；歐洲大陸風格的","s":"The boutique European hotel serves a light continental breakfast consisting of warm croissants, fruit, and coffee.","t":"這家歐洲精品飯店提供精緻的歐式（大陸風格）早餐，包含熱可頌麵包、水果和咖啡。"},{"w":"cradle","p":"n.","d":"a small bed for a baby, especially one that rocks from side to side","c":"搖籃；發源地（可數）","s":"The exhausted father fell asleep in the armchair while gently rocking his sleeping baby in the wooden cradle.","t":"疲憊的父親在扶手椅上睡著了，手裡還輕輕搖著木製搖籃裡熟睡的嬰兒。"},{"w":"from cradle to grave","p":"phr.","d":"from birth to death; throughout the entirety of one's life","c":"從生到死；終生（片語）","s":"The comprehensive national healthcare system was designed to provide medical care for all citizens from cradle to grave.","t":"這項全面的全民健保體系旨在為所有公民提供從生到死（終生）的醫療照護。"},{"w":"disc","p":"n.","d":"a flat, thin, circular object or electronic storage medium (also spelled disk)","c":"光碟；圓盤；磁盤（可數）","s":"Because modern slim laptops rarely include a built-in disc drive, I had to purchase an external one.","t":"因為現代超薄筆記型電腦很少內建光碟機，所以我不得不購買一台外接式光碟機。"},{"w":"donut","p":"n.","d":"a small fried cake of sweetened dough, typically in the shape of a ring or ball","c":"甜甜圈（可數，亦拼作 doughnut）","s":"I enjoyed a freshly glazed donut along with a cup of hot black tea for my afternoon office snack.","t":"我在辦公室下午茶時間享用了一個新鮮出爐的糖霜甜甜圈和一杯熱紅茶。"},{"w":"explode","p":"v.","d":"to burst or shatter violently from internal pressure; to increase suddenly","c":"爆炸；破裂；激增（動詞）","s":"Online video gaming and esports have exploded in popularity among young teenagers over the past decade.","t":"在過去十年間，線上電玩與電子競技在年輕青少年群體中的受歡迎程度激增／爆棚。"},{"w":"explosion","p":"n.","d":"a violent and destructive shattering or blowing apart of something","c":"爆炸；爆發；激增（可數）","s":"Residents living three miles away could still hear the terrifying sound of the chemical factory explosion.","t":"住在三英里外的居民依然能聽見化工廠爆炸的可怕巨響。"},{"w":"golf","p":"n.","d":"an outdoor game played on a large open-air course with clubs and a small hard ball","c":"高爾夫球運動（不可數）","s":"Both physical stamina and intense mental concentration are essential if you wish to play golf professionally.","t":"如果你想以打高爾夫球為職業，充沛的體力與高度的心理專注力都是不可或缺的。"},{"w":"golfer","p":"n.","d":"a person who plays golf, especially professionally or enthusiastically","c":"高爾夫球手；打高爾夫球的人（可數）","s":"The young Taiwanese golfer practiced hitting hundreds of golf balls every single day to prepare for tournaments.","t":"那位年輕的台灣高爾夫球手每天練習擊打數百顆球，為各項大賽做準備。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"housekeeper – nun","cards":[{"w":"housekeeper","p":"n.","d":"a person employed to manage a household and direct or perform domestic tasks","c":"管家；女管家；負責家務者（可數）","s":"The busy doctor hired an experienced housekeeper to take care of daily cooking and keep the large house clean.","t":"忙碌的醫生聘請了一位經驗豐富的管家來負責日常烹飪並保持大房子的清潔。"},{"w":"hug","p":"v.","d":"to squeeze someone tightly in one's arms, typically to express affection","c":"緊抱；擁抱（動詞）","s":"When the two long-lost sisters met at the airport arrival gate, they tearfully hugged each other.","t":"當失散多年的兩姐妹在機場接機門相遇時，她們眼泛淚光地彼此相擁。"},{"w":"hug","p":"n.","d":"an act of holding someone tightly in one's arms","c":"擁抱（可數）","s":"Many friendly Americans warmly greet their close friends with a hearty handshake and a gentle hug.","t":"許多友善的美國人會以熱情有力的握手和溫柔的擁抱來迎接摯友。"},{"w":"label","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of paper or cloth attached to an object giving information about it","c":"標籤；商標；稱號（可數）","s":"The careful shopper always reads the nutritional label on the cereal box to check for added sugar.","t":"謹慎的購物者總會仔細閱讀麥片盒上的營養標籤，以確認是否含有添加糖。"},{"w":"label","p":"v.","d":"to attach a label to; to describe or categorize someone or something","c":"貼標籤於；歸類；把…稱為（動詞）","s":"To avoid confusion during the office relocation, please clearly label each cardboard box with your department name.","t":"為了避免在辦公室搬遷期間產生混亂，請用您的部門名稱清楚標記／貼標籤於每個紙箱。"},{"w":"log","p":"n.","d":"a part of the trunk or a large branch of a tree; an official record of events","c":"原木；日誌；航海航行紀錄（可數）","s":"The captain of the cargo ship meticulously keeps a daily log of weather conditions and sea routes.","t":"貨輪船長一絲不苟地維護著記錄天氣狀況與航線的每日航行日誌。"},{"w":"log on / in","p":"v.phr.","d":"to connect to a computer system or network by entering a username and password","c":"登入；連線到系統（動詞片語）","s":"You must enter your student identification number and secure password to log on to the university portal.","t":"您必須輸入您的學生證號與安全密碼才能登入大學資訊入口網站。"},{"w":"lollipop","p":"n.","d":"a large round piece of hard candy on the end of a small stick","c":"棒棒糖（可數）","s":"The kind pediatrician gave the brave little girl a strawberry lollipop after she finished her vaccine shot.","t":"在勇敢的小女孩打完疫苗後，親切的兒科醫生給了她一支草莓棒棒糖。"},{"w":"melt","p":"v.","d":"to change from a solid to a liquid state by heat; to soften","c":"融化；熔化；融解；軟化（動詞）","s":"Because the summer afternoon was extremely hot, my vanilla ice cream cone began to melt all over my fingers.","t":"因為夏日午後極度酷熱，我的香草冰淇淋甜筒開始融化並流得我滿手都是。"},{"w":"melt away","p":"v.phr.","d":"to disappear completely and gradually, or to dissolve","c":"融化消失；消散無蹤（動詞片語）","s":"As the warm spring sunshine illuminated the valley, all the thick winter snow began to melt away.","t":"當溫暖的春日陽光照亮山谷時，所有厚實的冬季積雪開始消融退去。"},{"w":"mental","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the mind, intellect, or mental health disorders","c":"心理的精神的；智力的","s":"Doctors strongly emphasize that maintaining good mental health is just as important as keeping physically fit.","t":"醫生強烈強調，保持良好的心理／精神健康與維持身體強健同等重要。"},{"w":"monk","p":"n.","d":"a member of a religious community of men living under vows of poverty and chastity","c":"僧侶；修道士；和尚（可數）","s":"The silent medieval Christian monk spent decades copying ancient religious manuscripts by hand.","t":"沉靜的中世紀基督教修道士花了數十年時間親手抄錄古老的宗教手稿。"},{"w":"nun","p":"n.","d":"a member of a religious community of women, typically living under vows in a convent","c":"修女；尼姑（可數）","s":"The kind Catholic nun dedicated her entire life to teaching underprivileged children in rural mountain schools.","t":"那位仁慈的天主教修女將她的一生奉獻給偏遠山區學校弱勢孩童的教學。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"pepper – region","cards":[{"w":"pepper","p":"n.","d":"a pungent hot-tasting powder prepared from dried peppercorns; a hollow vegetable","c":"胡椒粉；甜椒；辣椒（可數/不可數）","s":"The chicken soup tasted a bit mild, so Colin added a pinch of black pepper and sea salt.","t":"雞湯喝起來味道有點淡，所以柯林加了一小撮黑胡椒粉和海鹽。"},{"w":"photographer","p":"n.","d":"a person who takes photographs, especially as a professional job","c":"攝影師；拍照者（可數）","s":"The young bride is currently searching for a talented wedding photographer to capture her ceremony moments.","t":"年輕的新娘目前正在尋找一位才華洋溢的婚禮攝影師來捕捉婚禮上的精彩瞬間。"},{"w":"photograph","p":"n.","d":"a picture made using a camera, in which an image is focused onto film or sensor","c":"照片；相片（可數）","s":"She keep an old framed photograph of her smiling grandparents on her bedroom study desk.","t":"她在臥室書桌上保留了一張她祖父母微笑的帶框老照片。"},{"w":"pile","p":"n.","d":"a heap of things laid or lying one on top of another","c":"一堆；疊（可數）","s":"There was a huge pile of dry autumn leaves in the backyard that needed raking and bagging.","t":"後院裡有一大堆乾燥的秋天落葉，需要用耙子耙起並裝袋。"},{"w":"pile","p":"v.","d":"to place things one on top of another; to accumulate","c":"堆疊；堆積；蜂擁而入（動詞）","s":"At the holiday buffet, excited children eagerly piled their plates high with delicious roast beef and fries.","t":"在節日自助餐會上，興奮的孩子們急切地將盤子堆滿了美味的烤牛肉和薯條。"},{"w":"pile up","p":"v.phr.","d":"to accumulate in large quantities; to cause a multi-vehicle traffic accident","c":"積累；堆積如山；（車輛）連環追撞","s":"Whenever Ms. Taylor takes a sick leave, unanswered business emails rapidly pile up in her inbox.","t":"每當泰勒女士請病假時，未回覆的公務郵件便迅速在她的收件匣中堆積如山。"},{"w":"poster","p":"n.","d":"a large printed picture, notice, or advertisement displayed in a public place","c":"海報；宣傳招貼（可數）","s":"The bedroom walls of the music-loving teenager were completely covered with colorful rock band poster.","t":"這位熱愛音樂的青少年的臥室牆壁上貼滿了色彩繽紛的搖滾樂團海報。"},{"w":"probable","p":"adj.","d":"likely to happen or to be true; having a high probability","c":"很可能的；大概的","s":"Given the dark gathering clouds and thunder, rain is the most probable outcome for this afternoon.","t":"考慮到烏雲密布與雷聲隆隆，今天下午下雨是最很可能的結果。"},{"w":"probably","p":"adv.","d":"almost certainly; as far as one can reasonably tell","c":"很可能；大概（副詞）","s":"Because the subway is experiencing technical delays, we will probably arrive thirty minutes late for dinner.","t":"因為地鐵發生技術性延誤，我們吃晚餐很可能會遲到三十分鐘。"},{"w":"professor","p":"n.","d":"a university teacher of the highest academic rank","c":"教授；大學正教授（可數）","s":"Drew stayed after the biology lecture to ask his distinguished professor several questions regarding genetics.","t":"德魯在生物課結束後留下來，向他卓越的教授請教了幾個關於遺傳學的問題。"},{"w":"proof","p":"n.","d":"evidence or argument establishing or helping to establish a fact or the truth","c":"證明；證據（不可數/可數）","s":"The police had indisputable video proof that the suspect broke into the jewelry vault late at night.","t":"警方掌握了無可爭辯的錄影證據／證明，證實嫌疑人曾在深夜闖入珠寶保險庫。"},{"w":"regional","p":"adj.","d":"relating to or characteristic of a specific geographic region","c":"地區的；區域性的；地方特色的","s":"While touring southern Italy, we thoroughly enjoyed tasting all of the authentic regional cooking and cheeses.","t":"在義大利南部旅行期間，我們非常盡興地品嚐了所有道地的地方特色菜餚與乳酪。"},{"w":"region","p":"n.","d":"an area or division, especially part of a country or the world","c":"地區；地帶；領域（可數）","s":"The mountainous northern region of the country experiences extremely cold winters with heavy snowfall.","t":"該國多山的山嶺北部地區歷經極度寒冷且大雪紛飛的冬季。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"ripe – wealth","cards":[{"w":"ripe","p":"adj.","d":"developed to the point of readiness for harvesting and eating; fully matured","c":"成熟的；時機成熟的","s":"The honeydew melon sitting on the kitchen table is completely ripe and sweet, so we should eat it today.","t":"放在廚房餐桌上的蜜瓜已經完全成熟且香甜，所以我們今天就該吃掉它。"},{"w":"steady","p":"adj.","d":"firmly fixed, supported, or balanced; regular and continuous","c":"穩定的；沉穩的；持續不斷的","s":"Flying a colorful kite high in the sky is much easier when there is a gentle and steady afternoon breeze.","t":"當午後有陣陣輕柔而穩定的微風時，把五彩風箏高高放上天空會容易得多。"},{"w":"steady","p":"v.","d":"to make or become steady or balanced","c":"使穩定；使平靜；穩住（動詞）","s":"David took three slow, deep breaths to steady his shaky nerves before stepping onto the stage.","t":"大衛在走上講台前做了三次緩慢的深呼吸，以穩定／平靜他緊張顫抖的神經。"},{"w":"slow and steady","p":"phr.","d":"gradual and consistent progress that eventually leads to success","c":"循序漸進；持之以恆（穩紮穩打）","s":"In Aesop's famous fable about the tortoise and the hare, slow and steady consistently wins the race.","t":"在伊索著名的龜兔賽跑寓言中，持之以恆／穩紮穩打最終贏得了比賽。"},{"w":"stool","p":"n.","d":"a backless, armless single seat supported on legs or a central pedestal","c":"凳子；高腳凳（可數）","s":"Customers in the cozy downtown cafe comfortably sat on high wooden stool along the counter.","t":"舒適的市中心咖啡館裡的顧客們舒適地坐在吧檯旁的木製高腳凳上。"},{"w":"tent","p":"n.","d":"a portable shelter of fabric or canvas supported by poles and rope","c":"帳篷（可數）","s":"The grassy flat clearing beside the mountain stream is an ideal location for us to put up our tent.","t":"山間溪流旁的平坦草地是我們搭設帳篷的理想地點。"},{"w":"thumb","p":"n.","d":"the short, thick first digit of the human hand, opposable to the other four fingers","c":"大拇指（可數）","s":"Vincent's sprained right thumb significantly affected his daily ability to type on the computer keyboard.","t":"文森扭傷的右手大拇指嚴重影響了他每天在電腦鍵盤上打字的能力。"},{"w":"all thumbs","p":"phr.","d":"clumsy and awkward, especially with one's hands","c":"笨手笨腳的；笨拙的（片語）","s":"Don't let clumsy Joe handle the fragile antique glasses because he is completely all thumbs this morning.","t":"別讓笨拙的喬碰那些脆弱的古董玻璃杯，因為他今天早晨完全笨手笨腳的。"},{"w":"rule of thumb","p":"n.phr.","d":"a broadly accurate guide or principle based on practice rather than theory","c":"經驗法則；黃金準則（常用單數）","s":"As a practical rule of thumb, short fictional stories should be written between five and ten thousand words.","t":"作為一個實用的經驗法則，虛構短篇故事的篇幅應寫在五千至一萬字之間。"},{"w":"thumbs up","p":"n.phr.","d":"a gesture or signal indicating approval, satisfaction, or encouragement","c":"豎起大拇指；稱讚；贊同；准許（常用單數或複數）","s":"The film critic gave the thrilling new sci-fi movie an enthusiastic thumbs up for its marvelous acting.","t":"影評人為這部扣人心弦的新科幻電影精彩的演技給予了熱情的大力讚許（豎起大拇指）。"},{"w":"troop","p":"n.","d":"soldiers or armed forces; a group of people or animals of a specified kind","c":"軍隊；部隊（常用複數 troops）；一群","s":"The international peacekeeping coalition decided to send specialized medical troops to the conflict region.","t":"國際維和聯盟決定派遣專門的醫療部隊前往衝突地區。"},{"w":"wealthy","p":"adj.","d":"having a great deal of money, resources, or assets; rich","c":"富有的；富裕的","s":"The generous and wealthy businessman regularly donates large sums of money to build rural schools.","t":"那位慷慨且富有的商人經常捐贈巨額款項為偏鄉興建學校。"},{"w":"wealth","p":"n.","d":"an abundance of valuable possessions, money, or intellectual resources","c":"財富；豐富；大量（不可數）","s":"The newly renovated public library offers an enormous wealth of historical information to researchers.","t":"新翻修的公共圖書館為研究人員提供了極其豐富的歷史資訊。"}]}];
